
  Field Notes is live at https://fieldnotes.example.com

  You're signed in to the admin in your browser.

  Setup couldn't remove its access to your Cloudflare
  account. In your Cloudflare profile, select Manage OAuth
  authorizations. Then find cairn and select Revoke.

  Edit your site    fieldnotes.example.com/admin
  Invite an editor  Admin > Editors
  Read the docs     cairn.pub/docs

  Setup took 8:12.
